 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up to 4 players (or go solo) and get paid for fulfilling the orders! You have to carry cargo, dodge obstacles and adapt to ever-growing chaos. From making the perfect delivery plan to coping with a spectacular failure, every single day will have hilarious moments you won’t stop talking about long after the working day is over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is your greatest tool. Share duties, organize the delivery of cargoes and help each other cope with ever growing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/4f5a8800a00e5b7538b94d5ea80de1a8.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/4f5a8800a00e5b7538b94d5ea80de1a8.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/4f5a8800a00e5b7538b94d5ea80de1a8.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R.O.P.E </strong>(Remote Object Positioning Equipment)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the R.O.P.E to grab, drag, lift and throw cargo around the warehouse. Carry heavy items together, deliver delicate objects carefully or send all the cargo flying through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/85a624c4c7329002c4b4f7b60f0c65aa.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/85a624c4c7329002c4b4f7b60f0c65aa.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/85a624c4c7329002c4b4f7b60f0c65aa.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get the Job Done</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right cargo, pack and sort it and send it to delivery. Make sure not to damage it to get more coins. <br>The faster you complete the order and the better condition you keep your cargo in, the greater your profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/0eea6cf9312027b2539f4b9c7e30b002.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/0eea6cf9312027b2539f4b9c7e30b002.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/0eea6cf9312027b2539f4b9c7e30b002.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Hard, Play Hard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go and test yourself in various party modes, including races, games, basketball and others. Work is not always serious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/c7569bb43f8156e8e543398ce1965e33.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/c7569bb43f8156e8e543398ce1965e33.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/c7569bb43f8156e8e543398ce1965e33.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic online co-op</strong> for <strong>1–4 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven gameplay</strong> every mistake creates new challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn the ropes of using the R.O.P.E</strong> move cargo in creative and unpredictable ways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique warehouses</strong> each with their own danger and rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes</strong>, including Order Mode, races, co-op challenges and party games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong> and stand out from your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, endless chaos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More warehouses, cosmetics, and challenges coming in future updates</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up to 4 players (or go solo) and get paid for fulfilling the orders! You have to carry cargo, dodge obstacles and adapt to ever-growing chaos. From making the perfect delivery plan to coping with a spectacular failure, every single day will have hilarious moments you won’t stop talking about long after the working day is over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is your greatest tool. Share duties, organize the delivery of cargoes and help each other cope with ever growing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/4f5a8800a00e5b7538b94d5ea80de1a8.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/4f5a8800a00e5b7538b94d5ea80de1a8.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/4f5a8800a00e5b7538b94d5ea80de1a8.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R.O.P.E </strong>(Remote Object Positioning Equipment)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the R.O.P.E to grab, drag, lift and throw cargo around the warehouse. Carry heavy items together, deliver delicate objects carefully or send all the cargo flying through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/85a624c4c7329002c4b4f7b60f0c65aa.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/85a624c4c7329002c4b4f7b60f0c65aa.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/85a624c4c7329002c4b4f7b60f0c65aa.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get the Job Done</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right cargo, pack and sort it and send it to delivery. Make sure not to damage it to get more coins. <br>The faster you complete the order and the better condition you keep your cargo in, the greater your profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/0eea6cf9312027b2539f4b9c7e30b002.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/0eea6cf9312027b2539f4b9c7e30b002.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/0eea6cf9312027b2539f4b9c7e30b002.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Hard, Play Hard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go and test yourself in various party modes, including races, games, basketball and others. Work is not always serious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/c7569bb43f8156e8e543398ce1965e33.poster.avif?t=1789233264\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/c7569bb43f8156e8e543398ce1965e33.webm?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958280/extras/c7569bb43f8156e8e543398ce1965e33.mp4?t=1789233264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic online co-op</strong> for <strong>1–4 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven gameplay</strong> every mistake creates new challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn the ropes of using the R.O.P.E</strong> move cargo in creative and unpredictable ways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique warehouses</strong> each with their own danger and rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes</strong>, including Order Mode, races, co-op challenges and party games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong> and stand out from your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, endless chaos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More warehouses, cosmetics, and challenges coming in future updates</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
